@baseUrl        = http://scenario.localhost/api
@projectUuid    = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@sharedSecret   = super-secret-key-32-chars-long!!

# After user-register — paste the returned iframe_launch_token here
@launchToken    = PASTE_LAUNCH_TOKEN_HERE

# After exchange — paste the returned tokens here
@accessToken    = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@refreshToken   = PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE

###
### ── 1. User Register ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###

### Register new user (creates user + membership + launch token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/project/{{projectUuid}}/user-register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sharedSecret}}

{
  "login": "user_123",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "name": "Иван Иванов",
  "external_id": "crm_user_123",
  "roles": [
    "client",
    "manager"
  ]
}

### Register without email (generates fake email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/project/{{projectUuid}}/user-register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sharedSecret}}

{
  "login": "user_no_email",
  "name": "Без Email",
  "roles": [
    "client"
  ]
}

### Register with external_id only (no email, no login match)
POST {{baseUrl}}/project/{{projectUuid}}/user-register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sharedSecret}}

{
  "login": "some_login",
  "name": "External User",
  "external_id": "ext_456",
  "roles": [
    "viewer"
  ]
}

### 404 — project not found
POST {{baseUrl}}/project/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/user-register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sharedSecret}}

{
  "login": "user_123",
  "name": "Test",
  "roles": [
    "client"
  ]
}

### 401 — wrong shared secret
POST {{baseUrl}}/project/{{projectUuid}}/user-register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer wrong-secret

{
  "login": "user_123",
  "name": "Test",
  "roles": [
    "client"
  ]
}

### 422 — validation error (missing required fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/project/{{projectUuid}}/user-register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{sharedSecret}}

{}

###
### ── 2. Exchange ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###

### Exchange launch token for access + refresh tokens
# Paste iframe_launch_token from user-register response into @launchToken above
POST {{baseUrl}}/embed/auth/exchange
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://scenario.localhost

{
  "token": "{{launchToken}}"
}

### Exchange without Origin header (should fail if project.host is set)
POST {{baseUrl}}/embed/auth/exchange
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{launchToken}}"
}

### 401 — token not found
POST {{baseUrl}}/embed/auth/exchange
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "nonexistent-token"
}

### 422 — missing token field
POST {{baseUrl}}/embed/auth/exchange
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
### ── 3. Refresh ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###

### Refresh access token (token rotation)
# Paste refresh_token from exchange response into @refreshToken above
POST {{baseUrl}}/embed/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 401 — refresh token not found / already rotated
POST {{baseUrl}}/embed/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "nonexistent-refresh-token"
}

### 422 — missing field
POST {{baseUrl}}/embed/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
### ── 4. Logout ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
###

### Logout (revokes access token + refresh token)
# Paste access_token from exchange/refresh response into @accessToken above
POST {{baseUrl}}/embed/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 401 — no auth
POST {{baseUrl}}/embed/auth/logout
